    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0132" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg12"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ecuadorean Chargé to
                        the Acting Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Ecuador</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-07-03"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 3, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With profound sorrow this legation has
                    learned of the unexpected death of Hon. John Hay, Secretary of State.</p>
                <p>On behalf of both my government and myself I present to your excellency my
                    heartiest manifestation of condolence for the irreparable loss that the United
                    States has suffered by the death of one of its most prominent statesmen, this
                    sad event being a cause of the greatest sorrow not only to this nation, but to
                    the whole American continent.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Serafin S.
                    Wither.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
